<title>FRANCE: Bollore Technologies Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Bollore Technologies Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover Bollore Technologies	    5,837    vs    5,495</p>
<p>    Scac Delmas Vieljeux	   5,455    vs    5,109</p>
<p>NOTE - Groupe Bollore, which controls both companies, said in a statement that the sales at Bollore Technologies would have been up 5.5 percent at unchanged exchange rates and a constant structure.</p>
<p>It said SCA Delmas Vieljeux would have had a sales increase to 5.42 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
